SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Guest DJ Karen Funshine
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, July 3\nEvening Dance 
 Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGuest D
 J Karen Funshine \\| Facilitator Kris Hostikka\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout 
 Guest DJ Karen Funshine\nKaren Funshine (Karen Smith) has been dancing sin
 ce age 3\, with movement as her lifelong ally. A veteran raver & EDM enthu
 siast\, she was delighted to discover 5Rhythms and ecstatic dance 10 years
  ago in Austin - a sober and judgment-free space to get wild & free. She
 ’s since facilitated many women’s conscious dance circles and a vibran
 t live-instrument dance - weaving music and somatic movement to alchemize 
 emotion\, open the heart\, and awaken joy. Recently relocated to Asheville
 \, Karen is honored to share her passion and playfulness with her beautifu
 l new community through the universal language of music and dance.\n\n\\~\
 \~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors cl
 ose promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away.
  Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket P
 rices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of fun
