 kka loves creating a sacred container that takes you on an inward journey 
 utilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment to chaos and down into s
 tillness and integration. She feels that movement is medicine\, weaving in
 tention and a rich blend of world beats where it’s possible to be with w
 hat is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt and moved. You can find he
 r dance mixes here:[ ](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka) [http://soundcl
 oud.com/dj-kristikka](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n
 \\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promp
 tly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please b
 e on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $1
 5 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-
